Z||000000||DaRkLoRD||02-01-2000||09:27 PM||||I need to find out how to send files over FTP or HTTP from a win32 app.. The best program I've seen in a while that does this is PIP, which is why I'm asking here.<P>Would Cliff or any other programmers be able to help me? links, code samples, anything..<P>thanks!!!!!||||reg||1
