Z||000010||mwbackus||02-04-2000||04:07 AM||||The winsock api calls needed to do something like this are easily avoided by using an activeX control.  This also makes it much easier to inplement in a wide range of programs(eg.. MS word or access).  Although it is a bit expensive, I have found the following activeX component offered by Mabry software to be quite useful for tasks such as this:<BR> <A HREF="http://www.mabry.com/ftpx/index.htm" TARGET=_blank>http://www.mabry.com/ftpx/index.htm</A> <P><BR>Mike<BR>||||reg||1
